nstallation of essential infrastructure\nEstablishing a permanent Gathering venue','land',NULL,30,1),(30,'values','Inspire','Revival through prayer and worship.','spark',NULL,10,1),(31,'values','Impact','Compassion that transforms communities.','heart',NULL,20,1),(32,'values','Empower','Equipping lives for lasting change.','community',NULL,30,1),(33,'highlights','Three-day conference','27–29 November 2026, Ibadan, Oyo State, Nigeria.','calendar',NULL,10,1),(34,'highlights','Up to 5,000 people served','Through medical and compassion outreach.','community',NULL,20,1),(35,'highlights','Medical outreach','Blood pressure, diabetes and eye screening, and essential medication.','medical',NULL,30,1),(36,'highlights','Heart of Compassion','Community feeding for vulnerable families.','compassion',NULL,40,1),(37,'highlights','The Gathering Land','Permanent land development in Ido LGA, Oyo State.','land',NULL,50,1),(38,'highlights','Interdenominational','Uniting ministers, families, and communities in prayer.','globe',NULL,60,1),(39,'medical_services','Blood pressure screening',NULL,NULL,NULL,10,1),(40,'medical_services','Diabetes screening',NULL,NULL,NULL,20,1),(41,'medical_services','Basic medical consultation',NULL,NULL,NULL,30,1),(42,'medical_services','Eye care support',NULL,NULL,NULL,40,1),(43,'medical_services','Distribution of essential medications',NULL,NULL,NULL,50,1),(44,'medical_services','Health education & preventive care',NULL,NULL,NULL,60,1),(45,'land_vision','Host future Gathering conferences',NULL,'calendar',NULL,10,1),(46,'land_vision','Provide space for outreach',NULL,'community',NULL,20,1),(47,'land_vision','Support medical and compassion initiatives',NULL,'medical',NULL,30,1),(48,'land_vision','Enable long-term ministry growth and training',NULL,'spark',NULL,40,1),(49,'bus_stops','Elebu Junction','Elebu axis',NULL,NULL,10,1),(50,'bus_stops','Apata','Wema Bank',NULL,NULL,20,1),(51,'bus_stops','New Garage','Transit hub',NULL,NULL,30,1),(52,'bus_stops','Chall